flowchart TD
    A[API request enters LoggedRoute] --> B[Log method, path and handler]
    B --> C[Pydantic request validation]
    C -->|Invalid request| D[Return 422]
    C -->|Valid request| E[Route to controller, use case and repository]

    E --> F{Outcome}
    F -->|Success| G[Return response and status]
    F -->|Business validation| H[Return 400]
    F -->|Invalid login| I[Return 401]
    F -->|Out-of-scope scan| J[Return 403]
    F -->|Missing record| K[Return 404]
    F -->|Invalid scan state| L[Return 409]
    F -->|Scanner subprocess failure| M[Return 502]
    F -->|Scanner timeout| N[Return 504]
    F -->|Unexpected exception| O[Return 500]

    D --> P[Log rejection and duration]
    H --> P
    I --> P
    J --> P
    K --> P
    L --> P
    M --> P
    N --> P
    O --> Q[Log exception and duration]
    G --> R[Log completion, status and duration]

    P --> S[FastAPI serializes error response]
    Q --> S
